  "evidencia": "Page: Jan Egil Storholt. Sentence: Jan Egil Storholt (born 13 February 1949) is a former speed skater from Norway.\nPage: Jan Egil Storholt. Sentence: He was born in Trondheim.\nPage: Trondheim. Sentence: It is the third largest city in the country, with a population (2013) of 169,972 inhabitants within the city borders.\nPage: Sten Stensen. Sentence: Together with Amund Sjøbrend, Kay Stenshjemmet, and Jan Egil Storholt, he was one of the legendary \"four S-es\" (\"four aces\" in Norwegian), contemporary Norwegian top skaters in the 1970s and early 1980s.\nPage: Leif Jenssen. Sentence: Leif Jenssen (born March 19, 1948) is a former Norwegian weightlifter.",
