        "original_id": "691b1306-86bf-5db2-b13c-545a2882e809",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jan Egil Storholt, Sten Stensen, Amund Sjøbrend, Kay Stenshjemmet, Leif Jenssen\n- Places: Trondheim, Norway\n- Topics: speed skating, weightlifting, the \"four S-es\"\n\nFacts:\n- Leif Jenssen was born on March 19, 1948 and is a former Norwegian weightlifter.\n- Jan Egil Storholt was born on 13 February 1949 and is a former Norwegian speed skater.\n- Jan Egil Storholt was born in Trondheim, Norway.\n- In the 1970s and early 1980s, Sten Stensen, Amund Sjøbrend, Kay Stenshjemmet, and Jan Egil Storholt were known as the legendary Norwegian \"four S-es.\"\n- In 2013, Trondheim was the third largest city in Norway and had 169,972 inhabitants within the city borders.",
